   dict(t='Sem mãos segurado', sub='8 quadros · repete', refs=[R_PR, R_BK], txt=PIA + BXP + 'Sheet: NO-HANDER HELD in the air, a LOOP of 8 frames: the full no-hander pose of the approved No-hander sheet (both hands off the bars, arms wide open, knees gripping the seat, the bike under him) held, with a small living motion: the arms wave slowly up and down, the body bobs a few pixels. Frame 8 flows into frame 1.'),
