   dict(t='Mortal encolhido', sub='8 quadros · repete', refs=[R_PR, R_BK], txt=PIA + BXP + 'Sheet: TUCKED FLIP POSE on the BMX, a LOOP of 8 frames: a compact pose for spinning in the air: knees pulled up to the chest, elbows in, head tucked close to the handlebar, feet on the pedals, the bike tight under him; a small breathing motion between frames, the cap propeller spinning. Drawn UPRIGHT: the game turns the drawing for the flip. Frame 8 flows into frame 1.'),
