   dict(t='Corpo para trás e para frente no ar', sub='4 + 4 quadros', refs=[R_PR, R_BK], txt=PIA + BXP + 'Sheet: AIR BODY CONTROL, 8 frames: TOP ROW (1-4) leaning BACK in the air: pulling the handlebar to the chest, hips back, the bike nose up (the game turns it more); BOTTOM ROW (5-8) leaning FORWARD: pushing the handlebar away, chest over the bars, the bike nose down. In each row the first frame is the normal air pose and the fourth the strongest lean.'),
