   dict(t='Fundo distante com mais céu · dia', sub='32:12 · repete para os lados', refs=[R_FU, R_SA], txt=KEEP.replace('Use the attached image.', 'Use the attached FAR BACKGROUND of this game\'s BMX track.') + 'Make it TALLER, 32:12 (for example 2048 x 768), keeping the sea, the islands, the dunes and the horizon of the attached image at the same size in the BOTTOM part, and ADD MORE SKY on top: the same daylight sky with soft clouds continuing upward, a little deeper blue toward the top edge. The left and right edges must match perfectly (it repeats sideways). No text.'),
